<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-STRENCHI Q1 PROFIT 130,878 LATS.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-STRENCHI Q1 PROFIT 130,878 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strenchi Forestry's first quarter profit came to 130,878 lats on net turnover of 623,437 lats, the bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company's production costs during the first three months were 415,505 lats and its administrative expenses were 34,756 lats, the stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Strenchi's balance sheet value was 1.38 million lats and it had debtors of 269,218 lats and creditors of 151,020 lats.</p>
<p>Strenchi equity capital was 1.23 million lats, including 924,400 lats in company capital, the bourse statement said.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
